[l_english.EQUIPMENT_RANGED_HANDGUN]
Hoofgun (Infantry)

[l_english.EQUIPMENT_RANGED_HANDGUN_desc]
Ah, the trusty hoofgun, the pinnacle of pony self-defense technology. Keep any pony safe from their enemies, intruders, serial killers, angry mobs, drunks on the streets, overly enthusiastic karaoke singers, complete strangers that want to hug you ...and of course, themselves, if preferred.
§g“Shoot first, ask questions later. Preferably from a safe distance, close enough to hear the answer from the dead, but safe enough so the police would not come find you.”§!

[l_english.EQUIPMENT_RANGED_HANDGUN_short]
Hoofgun

[l_simp_chinese.EQUIPMENT_RANGED_HANDGUN]
燧发蹄铳 (步兵装备)

[l_simp_chinese.EQUIPMENT_RANGED_HANDGUN_desc]
啊，值得信赖的手铳，小马自卫科技的巅峰之作。它可以保护任何一匹小马避免以下威胁：仇人、入侵者、连环杀手、愤怒的暴徒、街边的醉鬼、过于热情的卡拉OK歌手、想要拥抱你的陌生小马 ...当然，如果他们愿意，这个名单也可以包括他们自己。
§g“先开枪，后问话。最好站在安全距离之外，稍微近一点你才能听清死者的回答，稍微远一些你才不会被警察找上门。”§!

[l_simp_chinese.EQUIPMENT_RANGED_HANDGUN_short]
燧发蹄铳
